# chktex configuration for this report.
#
# The suppressed warnings below are chktex disagreeing with decisions already
# settled for this document, not defects to repair:
#
#    8  Wrong length of dash. House style is a spaced hyphen ( - ), never an
#       em-dash. Enabling this asks for the dashes we removed on purpose.
#   12  Interword spacing after an abbreviation. \frenchspacing is on, so
#       inter-sentence and interword spacing are identical and \  does nothing.
#    9  `]' expected, found `)'.  Half-open intervals such as $[1.00,1.01)$.
#   17  Bracket count mismatch. Same cause, correct notation chktex cannot parse.
#    1  Command terminated with space. Fires on \nocopyright before a comment.
CmdLine { -n1 -n8 -n9 -n12 -n17 }
